  <section id="sec-summary"><h2>Summary</h2>
  <p>The Key Management Standard (KMS) is a set of security requirements for managing cryptographic keys used in blockchains, in order to minimise risks due to
    malicious attacks or accidental mis-use.</p>
  </section>

