<section id="sec-status">
<h2>Document Status and Feedback</h2>
<p>This document is the BSSC Key Management Standard version 1, developed by the Technical Working Group of the <a href="https://blockchainssc.org">Blockchain Security Standard Council</a> (BSSC Inc.).</p>

<p>The BSSC requests feedback on this document, which can be provided through our <a href="https://www.blockchainssc.org/#interest-list">contact form</a>.</p>

<p>The BSSC may publish a new version of this specification, or another specification, that obsoletes this version,
in response to feedback received or other developments in the ecosystem.</p>

